			"notes": "Private testing prerelease for Minecraft 26.2.\n\nHighlights:\n- restores Etched disc patterns/colors and dynamic album cover artwork\n- restores bard trades/village houses, grindstone cover removal, disc cloning, parrot smoothing, HUD styling, and boombox arm behavior\n- fixes entity/block playback packet encoding and server menu configuration synchronization\n- adds persistent config plus packet, component, migration, resource, and trade parity checks\n\nImportant: replace alpha.3 on both the client and server. Mixed alpha.3/alpha.4 connections are unsupported because the playback packet format changed.\n\nStill requiring gameplay validation: in-world audio flow, two-client late joins, bard village generation, grindstone interaction, and visual animation/artwork checks. Arbitrary third-party ModelAlbumCover resource-pack models and Sophisticated Core integration remain deferred.\n\nSHA-256: 74c2fe95c416e8fa6f2151589f5425f93ed206195e6f99b70d8d2dc96e4ba258"
